{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23747","headline":"令狐相公拜尚书後有喜从镇归朝之作刘郎中先和因以继之 · 白居易","name":"令狐相公拜尚书後有喜从镇归朝之作刘郎中先和因以继之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"车骑新从梁苑回，履声佩响入中台。\n凤池望在终重去，龙节功成且纳来。\n金勒最宜乘雪出，玉觞何必待花开。\n尚书首唱郎中和，不计官资只计才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}